```bash
cd backend
uv venv
source .venv/bin/activate
uv run uvicorn app.main:app --reload
```
* **Interactive API Docs:** [http://localhost:8000/docs](http://localhost:8000/docs)

### 4. Run the Dashboard (Frontend)
```bash
cd frontend/src
npm install
npm run dev
```
